{"timestamp": 1770153100778.3457, "end_timestamp": 1770153100771, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"currentUserId": 1615, "visitUserId": 10129, "matched": "虽然相似点不同，但是和对方交流的时候可以从对方的兴趣爱好入手。生活是沟通的最好切入点。", "complement": "二人若有机会深入链接，或许能发掘出资源置换的潜在空间，实现共赢。", "luck": "虽暂时没发现重叠的兴趣点，但相互间有趣灵魂的相遇本身就是一种惊喜，期待下次偶遇。"}, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Tue, 03 Feb 2026 21:11:40 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1106819-1770153098760-5048", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1106819-1770153098760-5048", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "Connection": "keep-alive", "appservice-request-id": "3810"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false, "start_timestamp": 1770153100778.3457, "request": null}
